      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "@{5aaa3f5b9251562f89546368|full_name}: Most of creative stuff should be done in blender anyway, adding objects in unity only kills performance, and for typical simple avatar you only want to add animations and gestures in unity. So feature that would allow for very simplified avatar creation for less experienced players that just want own avatar would be very nice. (And implementation could still use unity)",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
