      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "@{5a4aaf7f758fa46d131cd36b|full_name}: to be honist a lot of the issues with the game today are caused becouse players are able to do as they please in unity and upload what garbage they want from unity. Neos has a not purfect solution but still lets you be fairly creative with your avatar. Once you are done creating the avatar in blender you upload the fbx. You pull out a editer tool in game and place a vr hmd where the head should be and hands where the hands should be and so on. All your editing is done in game and you can see how it looks ingame as you are editing it unlike unity and vrchat where somthing might look awsome in unity but turn out to be a turd in game.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
