      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "@{5b3406530132a20f8f95c128|full_name}: removing direct unity usage would help with a lot of issues, as then vrchat could control used components - like change cloth/dynamic bone implementation to another one at any point to improve performance for all avatar without reuploading stuff etc.\nBut I would hate to see this being used to limit possibilities, as I still love animators community in this game, I would never stay in this game for so long without them.\n\nBut creating advanced editor like that would be a lot of work for vrchat team, but you can start with small steps like this one, create smaller separate application for simple avatars and start adding new features later.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    }
